        "execSummary":  "Google\u0027s release of Gemini 3.8 Live and 3.5 Transcribe marks a significant step toward production-ready voice AI for enterprise customer engagement, with capabilities directly applicable to contact center automation, multilingual support operations, and real-time agent assist. For customer support leaders, the combination of sub-4% word error rate transcription and live voice agents that can execute background tasks during a call represents a credible path to reducing handle time and improving multilingual CX at scale. The pricing model ($0.005/min audio input, $0.018/min audio output) makes cost modeling straightforward for procurement and build-vs-buy analysis. The key caveat: Extended Thinking adds latency, and enterprises will need to evaluate response-time trade-offs carefully for synchronous customer-facing deployments.",
