        "summary":  "The article presents five coordinated quality assurance techniques for production LLM systems on Amazon Bedrock: adaptive pipeline orchestration, cross-account multi-model failover, real-time streaming evaluation, composite evaluation framework, and data accuracy verification. Together they achieve approximately 99% numerical accuracy while maintaining sub-13-second response times. The system was deployed for over 4,000 AWS executive leaders and maintained full availability across concurrent global usage during a six-month production deployment.",
