        "summary":  "Aderant, a legal industry software provider, deployed an intelligent ticket triage system using Amazon Nova Lite through Amazon Bedrock that automates support ticket classification and routing. In its first 2.5 weeks of production, the system processed 109 tickets at approximately 96% routing accuracy while recovering an estimated 8-14 engineering hours weekly at a cost under $30 monthly. The serverless solution integrates Jira, Confluence, Amazon Athena, and Microsoft SharePoint to enrich tickets with context before human review.",
